---
description: Screenshot Quarto RevealJS slides to see how a change renders
globs: ["presentations/**", "posters/**", "partials/**", "styles/**", "_brand.yml"]
alwaysApply: false
---

Slides are HTML rendered in a browser — reading the `.qmd` source does not tell you whether an
edit worked. After changing a deck, capture it and look at the image:

```bash
uv run pres shot <slug> --slide <index-or-id>
```

Then open the PNG it wrote and read `capture-report.md` beside it.

See `AGENTS.md` at the repo root for every flag, what to check in a capture, and the gotchas.
